cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "healthexpectancies: Functions to Calculate Health and Disability-Free Life Expectancies (DFLE) Using Sullivan Method"
abstract: >-
  An R package that calculates health expectancies, and in particular disability-free life
  expectancies (DFLE), with the Sullivan method, from mortality rates and prevalences of
  disability by age. It also smooths prevalences observed by age bracket into prevalences by
  single year of age, and projects prevalences and health expectancies, under hypotheses on
  life expectancies or with models estimated on past observations. It includes datasets for France.
